10)------------------READ_VORTEX: filters=$.o_comment not like "%special%requests%", function=Vortex Scan, estimated_cardinality=30000
11)----------------PROJECTION: expressions=c_custkey, estimated_cardinality=15000
12)------------------READ_VORTEX: function=Vortex Scan, estimated_cardinality=15000
